# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here. The
# image is built from source, so a stray .env, backup, log, key or data folder
# in the checkout can never be copied into it, whatever it is called.
#
# Everything listed is committed source. The packaging tests read the compose
# files, README.md and CHANGELOG.md, so they are included to let the in-image
# test run match a local one.
*

!go.mod
!*.go
!internal/
!web/
!Dockerfile
!docker-compose.yml
!docker-compose.dev.yml
!CHANGELOG.md
!README.md

# Belt and braces inside the allowed folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.tar.gz
**/node_modules
